# Phase 1 Foundation - 🎉 85% Complete!

## 📊 Summary

Successfully built the core foundation infrastructure for Gurudevi, replacing all hardcoded values with centralized Theme constants and translations. The app is now trilingual-ready and follows sanctuary design principles.

---

## ✅ What's Been Completed

### 1. Theme System (100%) 🎨

Created [Theme.ts](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/constants/Theme.ts) - **290 lines** of design tokens:

**Colors**: Sanctuary palette aligned with DESIGN_SYSTEM.md
- `sanctuarySaffron` (#E67E22) - Primary actions
- `voidIndigo` (#0f0f1e) - Dark background  
- `sageGreen`, `lotusDeepPink`, `twilightPurple` - Specialty colors
- Full light/dark mode color sets

**Typography**: Readable & respectful
- Font sizes: 12-64px (18px minimum body text)
- Line heights: 1.6x for Sinhala/Tamil readability
- Font weights: regular → bold

**Spacing**: 8px grid system
- xs: 4, sm: 8, md: 16, lg: 24, xl: 32, 2xl: 48, 3xl: 64

**Motion**: Breathing timings
- instant: 100ms → breathing: 4000ms (lotus cycle)
- Spring physics for organic animations

**Others**: Corners, shadows, borders, opacity, z-index

---

### 2. Internationalization (100%) 🌍

Created complete trilingual system with **Sinhala as default** (Core Commitment #2):

**Config**: [i18n/config.ts](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/i18n/config.ts)
- Default language: Sinhala ([si](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/types/User.ts#32-40))
- Fallback: English ([en](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/screens/AuthScreen.tsx#85-90))
- Supported: Si, Ta, En

**Translation Files**:
- [si.json](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/i18n/locales/si.json) - Sinhala (150+ keys)
- [ta.json](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/i18n/locales/ta.json) - Tamil (150+ keys)  
- [en.json](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/i18n/locales/en.json) - English (150+ keys)

**Translation Keys**: 
- `common` - save, cancel, delete, etc.
- `auth` - login, signup, email, password, role
- `tabs` - self, classroom, community, library, profile
- `self` - greetings, venting, rhythm, shadow, notes
- `classroom`, `community`, `library`, `profile`
- `errors` - common error messages

