### 6. Device Utilities (100%) 📱

**[utils/device.ts](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/utils/device.ts)** - Adaptive performance:
- [getDeviceTier()](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/utils/device.ts#26-40) - low (<2GB) / mid (2-4GB) / high (>4GB)
- [getDeviceConfig(tier)](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/utils/device.ts#41-80) - Adaptive settings:
  - **Low**: ❌ animations, gradients, shadows, blur
  - **Mid**: ✅ animations/gradients/shadows, ❌ blur
  - **High**: ✅ all visual effects

**Philosophy**: Works beautifully on low-end devices (teacher-centric)

