- **Before**: 
  ```typescript
  const [greeting, setGreeting] = useState('');
  useEffect(() => {
    const hour = new Date().getHours();
    if (hour < 12) setGreeting('Good Morning');
    // ...
  }, []);
  ```
- **After**:
  ```typescript
  const { t } = useTranslation();
  const greetingKey = getGreetingKey();
  // ...
  <Text>{t(greetingKey)},</Text>
  ```
- **Changes**:
  - Dynamic greeting via [getGreetingKey()](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/utils/time.ts#27-38) (time utility)
  - All text uses [t()](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/store/useStore.ts#5-9): [t('self.venting')](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/store/useStore.ts#5-9), [t('self.speakTruth')](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/store/useStore.ts#5-9)
  - `Theme.colors.*` for all colors
  - `Theme.spacing.*`, `Theme.corners.*` for layout
  - Haptic feedback on all button presses

